      "description": "GeoShare keeps the people who matter close, on one live map.\n\nSEE YOUR CIRCLE IN REAL TIME\n• See where family and friends are, whether they're moving, their battery level and when they last updated\n• Tap anyone for distance, speed and one-tap directions\n• Switch between Standard, Satellite and Hybrid maps\n\nADD PEOPLE IN SECONDS\n• Share your invite code or app link, or let a friend scan your QR code\n• Scan a friend's QR code with the built-in scanner\n• See who someone is before you send a request. Nobody joins your circle until they accept\n\nORGANISE YOUR CIRCLE\n• Tag people as Family, Friend, Colleague, Partner, Classmate or Neighbour\n• Filter your circle by tag in one tap\n\nSHARE YOUR LOCATION ON YOUR TERMS\n• Turn location sharing on or off any time with one switch\n• Only people you accept can see you\n• Send your current location to anyone through Messages, WhatsApp or email\n\nZONE ALERTS\n• Create zones like Home, School or Work with your own radius\n• Mark a zone as Safe or Danger\n• Get an alert when you arrive or leave\n\nSOS\n• One tap shares your live location with your whole circle\n\nNEARBY PLACES\n• Restaurants, cafés, fuel, ATMs, hospitals, pharmacies and more around you\n• Open any place in Maps for directions\n\nHISTORY\n• Your daily route, distance travelled and the places you stayed, stored only on your phone\n\nMADE FOR EVERY DAY\n• Light and Dark mode\n• No sign-up, no email, no password\n\nPRIVACY\nYour location is shared only with people you approve and is never sold. There are no ads and no tracking. Location is shared in the background only while sharing is switched on, and iOS always shows the location indicator.\n\nGeoShare is not an emergency service. In an emergency, call your local emergency number.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/gpstrackerprivacy/home\nTerms of Use: https://sites.google.com/view/gpstrackerterms/home",
